OpenMS ProSE 1.0.0 (experimental OpenMS 4 package extraction)

- Move ProSEAlgorithm and its report rendering into the shared OpenMS::ProSE backend.
- Package ProSE independently; keep reusable scientific primitives and all generic
  file-format readers/writers in the Core SDK.
- Preserve the C++ header/API used by the separately packaged pyOpenMS bindings.
- Move the scientific class test and the ProSE-dependent Bruker integration section
  with their backend; retain reader-only tests in Core.
- Extraction assisted by AI under Oliver Kohlbacher's direction; original author
  attribution is retained. Native validation is tracked by the parent project.
